/Title (Landslides can develop as rainfall infiltrates a slope, increases soil moisture and pore-water pressure, and changes the forces acting within the soil. Monitoring rainfall alone may not fully represent the evolving condition of a slope. This project therefore brings multiple indicators into a single simulation and warning workflow.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 661 0 R
/Next 739 0 R
>>
endobj
