713 0 obj
<<
/Title (The simulation follows a conceptual rainfall-to-instability progression. Rainfall is applied as an external input. As infiltration and wetting progress, soil moisture and pore-water pressure evolve. The stability indicator may decline as the slope weakens, while tilt and subsurface shear strain represent deformation-related behaviour.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 662 0 R
/Next 714 0 R
>>
endobj
